config ZTE_ZX279133_PWM_AUDIT
	tristate "ZTE ZX279133 PWM read-only audit"
	depends on ARM64 && OF && HAS_IOMEM
	help
	  Build a diagnostic driver that reads and logs raw MODE, PERIOD, and DUTY
	  registers for all ZX279133 PWM channels. It is intended to audit a
	  firmware-configured controller before a functional PWM driver is added.
	  It neither registers a PWM chip nor requests clocks, resets, or pinctrl.
	  The driver performs no hardware writes.
